<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY LEAGUE-NEW ZEALAND BEAT BRITAIN IN SECOND TEST.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-NEW ZEALAND BEAT BRITAIN IN SECOND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>PALMERSTON NORTH, New Zealand 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand beat Britain 18-15 (halftime 8-13) in the second rugby league test on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>New Zealand - Tries: Reuben Wiki 2, Gene Ngamu. Goals - Matthew Ridge 3.</p>
<p>Britain -  Tries: Alan Hunte, Denis Betts. Goals - Bobbie Goulding 3. Field goal - Goulding.</p>
